> Do I need to create both objects with the same API key to get the inverted and linear positions ?

Yes, they're not interchangeable on the same instance, cause they require preloading either this or that set of markets.
You have to use several instances of Binance:

```JavaScript
const binance = new ccxt.binance()
const binanceusdm = new ccxt.binanceusdm()
const binancecoinm = new ccxt.binancecoinm()
```

or

```JavaScript
const binance = new ccxt.binance({ 'options': { 'defaultType':spot' }})
const binanceusdm = new ccxt.binance({ 'options': { 'defaultType':future' }})
