        exchange.urls['api'] = exchange.urls['test'];
```

The caveat here is that test/sandbox URLs are not fully covered in ccxt yet, and not all exchanges offer them at all, so you will have to put correct URLs there by hand for now (until we unify that part completely). But if you feel like you want to help us to unify that functionality and you want to contribute by adding test URLs where they are missing – we will be happy for your help, feel free to make a PR. 

